        "Description": "终有一死 The Mortality\r关卡目标：\r*消灭傅罗阳\r*消灭梅孙\r*消灭向伟\r*消灭孙莫伟\r*无尸体被发现\r*藏匿所有尸体及昏迷的人的躯体\r*在撤离前摧毁实验，不要让哈什再次摧残平民\rThe Targets:\r*Eliminate Fu Luoyang\r*Eliminate Mei Sun\r*Eliminate Xiang Wei\r*Eliminate Mogwai Tzun\r*No bodies found\r*Hide all bodies\r*Destroy the experiment before you extract,and don&apos;t let Hush start it again.",
